! XRT-12 P1(IOL 17.15・据付・変更しない)= 星形のコアの中心の P ルータ。IS-IS CORE(L2・wide)と LDP。
! l2vpn evpn のルート リフレクタも兼ねる(XE1〜3 はクライアント。PE 側の BGP は課題 M11-7 で学ぶ側が書く)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.51 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE to XE1
 ip address 10.0.41.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CORE to XE2
 ip address 10.0.42.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description CORE to XE3
 ip address 10.0.43.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0051.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
router bgp 65000
 bgp router-id 10.255.0.51
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 no bgp default ipv4-unicast
 neighbor PE peer-group
 neighbor PE remote-as 65000
 neighbor PE description PE (route-reflector client)
 neighbor PE update-source Loopback0
 neighbor 10.255.0.41 peer-group PE
 neighbor 10.255.0.42 peer-group PE
 neighbor 10.255.0.43 peer-group PE
 !
 address-family l2vpn evpn
  neighbor PE send-community both
  neighbor PE route-reflector-client
  neighbor 10.255.0.41 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.42 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.43 activate
 exit-address-family
!
